# Elliott's setting (credited "J. W. Elliott" in Hill's 1915 Most Popular Mother Goose Songs too). Staccato as printed: eighths with eighth rests.
id hickory-dickory-dock
de Hickory Dickory Dock
en Hickory Dickory Dock
aliases dickory dickory dock;hickety dickety dock
tempo 132
bar 12
pickup 0
